      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay okay, i stopped. my arm is stinging so much though. i feel like the water isn't doing much to help the actual pain. is there any kind of cream or maybe like an antiseptic i can put on it after i'm done with the water? i have some hydrocortisone and some aloe vera gel, would one of those be better for the pain?",
